### ============================================
### USER LOCATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/location
### Rate Limit: 10 requests/minute per IP

@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@locationPath = /api/v1/users/location

### ============================================
### LOCATION MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### Update User Location
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{locationPath}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 40.7128,
  "longitude": -74.0060,
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "New York",
  "address": "123 Main St"
}

### Get User Location
GET {{baseUrl}}{{locationPath}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete User Location
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{locationPath}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

